      <mri:abstract>
        <gco:CharacterString>Administrative geometry for the provinces of Cuba and Isla de la Juventud
defined by the official Código de la División Político-Administrativa
(CoDPA). The geometry combines resolved Overture Maps administrative
division areas with Natural Earth land geometry.</gco:CharacterString>
