  <mdb:resourceLineage>
    <mrl:LI_Lineage>
      <mrl:statement>
        <gco:CharacterString>CoDPA defines the administrative inventory, official names, codes, levels,
and province-to-municipality relationships. Province-level CoDPA records and
Isla de la Juventud were linked to resolved Overture Maps division
identifiers. The corresponding Overture division-area geometries were
selected and dissolved by CoDPA province code and name. The resulting
geometries were intersected with the Natural Earth land geometry and stored
as multipolygons.</gco:CharacterString>
      </mrl:statement>
